========================================
PART 6 — NOT THERE YET
========================================

24. What ored50m Cannot Do Yet

- Train on many PCs.
- Answer questions (scripts\infer.py / scripts\generate.py read the old
  checkpoint format, not ored50m's best.pt).
- Train on the rows in Supabase (ored_training_data).
